  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have learned how to abort your bestow etherspells early, though at significant cost.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Gift Giver</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You may dismiss a bestow etherspell as a move action by spending ether points equal to twice the highest manifestation level used in the etherspell.</p>\n<p><strong>Normal:</strong> You cannot dismiss a bestow etherspell and must instead wait for its duration to expire naturally.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/ethermagic-feats#toc22\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
